menu "ESP32 denoiser benchmark"

config EDN_FREQUENCY_MODEL
    bool "Benchmark the frequency U-Net EDNFQ8 model"
    default n
    help
        Select the frequency model's full 257-bin complex frontend and graph.
        main/model.bin must contain EDNFQ8-v1. When disabled it must contain
        the global spectral TCN's EDNSI8-v2 model. A mismatch stops at init.

config EDN_MODEL_IN_INTERNAL_SRAM
    bool "Copy the model from flash to internal SRAM"
    default n
    help
        Allocate a 16-byte-aligned, byte-addressable internal SRAM buffer and
        copy the complete deployed model into it before initialization.
        Allocation failure stops the benchmark; it never falls back to flash.
        Keep disabled for the default flash-mapped model placement. Compare
        both settings on the same board and model to measure the tradeoff.

endmenu
